Sample Dataflows (concrete)

1. Canonicalize:

canonical = canonicalize(stream.json) // sorted keys, nfc, validated
streamDigest = SHA256(canonical)


2. Build Merkle:

For each entry: leaf = LEAF_PREFIX || SHA256(entryPayload)

Node hash = SHA256(NODE_PREFIX || left || right)

Padding: PAD_BYTES || u32be(totalLeaves) || u32be(layerIndex) || u32be(padVersion)



3. Prove:

witness = wasm.run(canonical, proofParams)
proof = prover.prove(witness)


4. Anchor:

Publish canonical → Arweave (tx A)

Submit proof.public_inputs + merkleRoot → GenesisVerifier (tx B)

Post Bitcoin OP_RETURN: BIPON39||merkleRoot||txB



5. Culture:

Elders sign streamDigest → attestation files anchored alongside Arweave.





